ivocally supports the claim that Yunheng Sun attended Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Moscow Aviation Institute", "Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Moscow Aviation Institute", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
